# Duplication probe, unit dl-b

Method: a copy of each owned file in Probe/ (Probe/Dup<Module>.lean, then Probe/Dup2<Module>.lean), identical except that the
target's `sorry` is replaced by `exact?` and the declaration is preceded by `set_option maxHeartbeats <N> in`. Same imports,
binders and statement as the real target; the target itself is not yet in the environment when `exact?` runs, so it cannot
match itself. Pass 1: maxHeartbeats 400000 for every target. Pass 2: maxHeartbeats 2000000 for each target that timed out in
pass 1 (other targets left as `sorry`). Each file checked alone with scripts/lean_check_tree.sh.

